<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area early Monday, USDA said.</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were not tested. Feedlots reporting limited inquiry from buyers. The last established price was $64.00 per cwt on Friday.  Monday's packer bids were $62.00-$63.00, with asking prices $65.00-$66.00. Confirmed - none</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
